{"path":"experimental/any/any","title":"std::experimental::any::any","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::any::</span>any","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/any/any","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Constructs a new any object.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">any<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">any<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> any<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">any<span class=\"br0\">(</span> any<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> ValueType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; any<span class=\"br0\">(</span> ValueType<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> value <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <code>any</code> object.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Constructs an empty object.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2,3)</span> Copies <span class=\"t-v\">(2)</span> or moves <span class=\"t-v\">(3)</span> content of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> into a new instance, so that any content is equivalent in both type and value to those of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> prior to the constructor call, or empty if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> is empty.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Constructs an object with initial content an object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw634\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>ValueType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/direct_initialization\">direct-initialized</a> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>ValueType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_copy_constructible\"><span class=\"kw539\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_copy_constructible</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw634\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>ValueType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, the program is ill-formed. This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/decay\"><span class=\"kw634\">std::<span class=\"me2\">decay_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>ValueType<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is not the same type as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">any</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ValueType\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> contained value type\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><code>std::decay_t&lt;ValueType&gt;</code> must meet the requirements of <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyConstructible</em></a>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another <code>any</code> object to copy or move from\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> value to initialize the contained value with\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2,4)</span> Throws any exception thrown by the constructor of the contained type.</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/any/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns an <code>any</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/any","title":"std::experimental::any"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::any::any","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Constructs a new any object."},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"ValueType"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other, value"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws any exception thrown by the constructor of the contained type."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns an any object"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":181,"codeBlockCount":0}
